Source: cta
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: CTA Team <cta-support@cern.ch>
Build-Depends: @BUILD_REQUIREMENTS@
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://cta.web.cern.ch
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: cta
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, libcap2-bin, opentelemetry-cpp (@OPENTELEMETRY_CPP_VERSION_CONSTRAINT@), xrootd-client@CTA_DEB_TEST_DEPENDS@
Recommends: systemd, logrotate
Description: @PROJECT_SUMMARY@
 Provides CTA services, shared libraries and administrative tools with
 PostgreSQL catalogue and scheduler support.
